What does this code print?

```java
interface Function<T, R> { R apply(T value); }
class Account {
    String kind() { return "base"; }
}
class Checking extends Account {
    @Override String kind() { return "checking"; }
}
class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Account account = new Checking();
        Function<Account, String> label = value -> value.kind();
        System.out.print(label.apply(account));
    }
}
```

